# ドラゴンクエストI・II (Dragon Quest I & II, Game Boy Color, CGB-AEDJ): the signs and kanji of its text, by code as
# the script has them (a byte, or 0xE5 and a byte for a kanji). Kana follow the order of the fifty sounds and are
# not listed (the script has them). Each code here was read off this game's screens, the page's codes held against
# its picture. Dragon Quest III's table (games/gbc/CGB-BD3J.tbl) gave the signs and a few kanji that held; its
# kanji are numbered otherwise (0xE565 and 0xE584 there are other kanji here), so none is taken from it unseen.
00=０
01=１
57=っ
58=ゃ
59=ゅ
94=＊
95=「
97=？
98=！
99=…
9A=。
9C=ー
E500=王
E501=子
E502=女
E505=大
E506=中
E509=年
E50A=月
E50B=日
E50E=入
E518=世
E520=申
E52B=平
E52C=和
E52D=手
E52F=来
E531=出
E532=光
E538=々
E543=伝
E548=何
E55B=代
E565=供
E56A=立
E56E=玉
E577=姫
E57B=神
E58E=治
E59A=封
E5A5=界
E5B1=宝
E5BA=性
E5BB=攻
